# First-boot notes (VirtualBox)

1. Start **HYD-DC1**, wait until AD/DNS are up (several minutes on first boot).
2. Start **HYD-CM1**, then **HYD-GW1**.
3. Log on as `{{LAB_DOMAIN}}\{{LAB_ADMIN_USER}}` (or local `Administrator`) using the password from `config/lab.env`.
4. Guest Additions are installed automatically the first time each server VM is started. Log on is automatic for that one session, then the VM reboots and the additions service reports in.
5. Clients (later): create differencing disks from `WindowsParent.vdi`, apply rendered unattend from `{{IDENTITY_DIR}}/`.

Ordered control: `./scripts/lab-ctl.sh start|stop|status`
